# Secrets must never be baked into the image -- they're injected at
# runtime via docker-compose's env_file. Without this file, Dockerfile's
# `COPY . .` copies .env (WayForPay, Supabase, OpenAI, Stripe, SendGrid/
# Resend keys, everything) straight into every image layer, readable by
# anyone with docker exec/inspect access and retained forever in old
# layers even after the secrets are rotated.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.staging.local.example

.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

logs/
*.log
